# Placement Insight 🔥

### Q1: Why indexes improve performance?

Because database avoids scanning every row.

---

### Q2: Most common index?

👉 B-Tree

---

### Q3: Which index is best for range queries?

👉 B-Tree

---

### Q4: Which index is fastest for exact match?

👉 Hash Index

---

### Q5: Why not create indexes on every column?

Because indexes also need maintenance during:

```sql
INSERT
UPDATE
DELETE
```

Too many indexes slow writes.

